# S1 forward sector-pattern monitor — quarterly cron schedule
#
# Purpose: gate-aside health monitoring per governance close audit
#   D:/vscode/meta-harness/audits/2026-05-05-S1-governance-close-layer-a-locked-event-study.md
#
# Lock (governance close §6.4): this monitor does NOT demote LAYER A LOCKED status.
# Forward Spearman drop or sign-agreement degradation informs paper §11 limitation
# note only. Full pattern reversal (Spearman<0 + sign≤1/6 + F-test fail across all
# horizons) triggers a separate governance audit at meta-harness — never auto-demotes.
#
# Schedule: 3rd Tuesday of Feb / May / Aug / Nov at 14:00 ET (post-SLOOS release window).
# SLOOS release calendar: typically late-Jan / late-Apr / late-Jul / late-Oct (quarter
# 첫 달 7-14일 발표).
#
# Run instructions:
#   1. Schedule via Windows Task Scheduler or POSIX cron (this file is reference-only;
#      Windows users use schtasks or Task Scheduler GUI to import equivalent trigger).
#   2. Working directory must be repo root: D:/vscode/sloos_sector_cross_section
#   3. .env must be present with FRED_API_KEY (free key).
#   4. WRDS courier read access available (E:/wrds-data-courier/).
#
# POSIX cron format (reference):
#   minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
#
# Quarterly Tuesdays (3rd Tue of Feb/May/Aug/Nov):
#   0 14 15-21 2,5,8,11 2 cd /d/vscode/sloos_sector_cross_section && uv run python -m sloos_sector_cross_section.forward_monitor >> .cron/forward_monitor.log 2>&1
#
# Windows Task Scheduler equivalent:
#   schtasks /create /tn "S1_forward_monitor" /tr "uv run python -m sloos_sector_cross_section.forward_monitor" \
#     /sc weekly /d TUE /st 14:00 /mo 3 /sd 2026-05-12

# Quarterly Tuesday on or after the 15th of Feb / May / Aug / Nov, 14:00 ET
0 14 15-21 2,5,8,11 2 cd /d/vscode/sloos_sector_cross_section && uv run python -m sloos_sector_cross_section.forward_monitor >> .cron/forward_monitor.log 2>&1
